 it  was his second titan transformation in a  short period of time we could only see  the upper body of his titan with one arm  that stopped the cannonball but it was  still enough to save his friends during  aaron's trial it's decided that he would  join survey court as part of squad levi  they are later sent to an abandoned  castle that had formerly served as the  base of operations for the survey corps  while there he meets squad leader hang  zoe who starts working with him helping  him get a better grip on his titan  powers during one of the experiments  with his titan abilities aaron is  lowered into a well before being told to  transform into a titan however aaron is  unable to activate his titan abilities  later while drinking tea with the rest  of the squad and questioning his titan  abilities he drops a spoon when he goes  on to reach it he suddenly activates his  titan abilities triggering his titan  transformation and leaving everyone in  shock confused soldiers drew their  swords thinking aaron transformed in  order to attack them when the smoke  cleared it's revealed that only his  right arm that was reaching for the  spoon transformed meaning that aaron  also possessed the power to transform  only a certain part of his body aaron  then learns that a titan transformation  requires him to have a clear goal in  mind in addition to self-injury aaron's  attack titan form is the main reason  parody island stood any chance in battle  against titans and marlene warriors  attack titan's powers combined with  aaron's passion and desire to kill every  titan in existence started the chain of  events in which aaron and survey core  defeated many titan shifters and learned  the truth about the outside world during  the battle of trust aaron was eaten  alive by in titan and inside the stomach  of the titan he saw other fellow  recruits lying dead this site combined  with intense feelings of desperation and  his drive to exterminate all titans  awoke his ability to transform into his  titan form for the first time when aaron  first transformed he didn't have control  of his titan form he could see straight  away that the attack titan was stronger  than pure titans of similar size even  though aaron still couldn't use its full  potential as a result his titan's limbs  were broken several times while punching  other pure titans and he was also easily  overwhelmed by a relatively low number  of titans when they swarmed him at the  same time once aaron got control of the  attack titan however it was a completely  different story his strength increased  at one point allowing him to lift a  boulder that mikasa remarked would have  been impossible for even a human of  proportion size to do while facing the  female titan in the titan forest he was  forced to adopt a more tactical approach  to fighting as annie had more experience  as a shifter and was a better  hand-to-hand fighter his titan skills  were put to the ultimate test as he  faced off with the armored titan in  season 2. upon finding out that his  fists did little to no damage to reiner  he was forced to switch his fighting  style despite being the physically  weaker and less durable titan aaron's  new style of fighting which included  tackles and holds would have eventually  led to reiner's defeat had the colossal  titan not interfered during his  experiments with hanji and the survey  corps aaron tried several times to  replicate the titan-heartening ability  annie had shown during their fight they  believed it could be the answer to  plugging the hole in shiganshina but  aaron didn't have any luck recreating  the crystal later during the battle at  rhys chapel after drinking a bottle  labeled armor aaron's titan form gained  the ability to harden its body as well  as create a web of pillars that appear  to originate from his titan body the  hardened pillars were incredibly durable  capable of preventing a cave-in as well  as shielding squad levi from the heat of  rodris's titan form aaron later mastered  hardening as we could see him focus his  ability only on his fists while fighting  against reiner's armor titan in  shiganshina when survey court launched a  retaliation attack on marley aaron  transformed into his attack titan form  multiple times showing that he now has  full control over his titan  transformations and abilities aaron also  shows an even greater aptitude for  battle applying all the titan fighting  techniques he's learned so far and using  his opponents against each other in  ingenious ways aaron obtained the power  of the warhammer titan during the raid  on liberio by devouring the younger  sister of willy upon returning to parody  island he was imprisoned for his  insubordination using his new warhammer  titan powers he manages to escape his  prison cell and was capable of sealing a  long tunnel with hardened titan flesh to  evade capture later while being on the  roof with peak eren spots a fleet of  marlin airships approaching their  location aaron is perplexed at marley's  decision to launch a counter-attack so  soon after the raid on liberio despite  yelena pleading with him to flee ground  aaron decides to fight marley on his own  he sees reiner transform into his armor  titan form mid air and decides to engage  him aaron initially gains the upper hand  on reiner using his fighting skills and  hardening to break through runner's  armor plating galliard in his jaw titan  form tries to ambush aaron from behind  but both he and reiner get caught and  pierced by aaron's warhammer spikes  aaron is shot in head with a round from  marley's anti-titan artillery leaving  his motor skills severely impaired aaron  is able to generate even more spikes to  stop the jaw titan's attacks unable to  defend from brainerd's attack aaron  finally manages to use his warhammer  abilities once more stopping both reiner  and galliard again warhammer titan's  abilities provided aaron with one thing  he was lacking strong defensive powers  it's clear that with the addition of  these new moves aaron became the most  powerful titan shifter excluding the  colossal titan and could battle against  multiple opponents at the same time  aaron's founding titan was drastically  different from yamir fritz's founding  titan and any other titan for that  matter initially much of the titan was  shrouded by the steam from the wall  titans but its sheer size was  immediately noted towering over the  horde of wall titans what appeared to be  the torso was devoid of flesh resembling  an enormous rib cage the head was the  only part of the body with much flesh  although it was significantly deformed  inside the titan aaron's head was  disconnected from his torso having been  decapitated and rejoined by yamir's  power the titan walked with its rib cage  undulating the ribs like a millipede's  legs aaron's founding titan had many  abilities he awakened and controlled  thousands of colossal titans in order to  destroy the entire world beyond parody  island since the founding titans are the  central point of intersection for the  paths of titans and humans alike it  could communicate with all of them  telepathically we saw how aaron used  this power to inform all the subjects of  emir about the decision to destroy the  world using the rumbling he also had the  ability to summon all the past titan  shifters back to life and controlled  them in order to fight against survey  court and marley warriors what makes  aaron different is that he had the power  to take the titan abilities away from  his friends so that they wouldn't be  able to stop him but he chose not to  giving humanity a chance to fight back  during the battle of heaven and earth  after soldiers finally managed to  destroy aaron's founding titan nape  everyone thought that the battle was  finally over sudden explosions out of  nowhere caught them off guard as aaron  emerges in his new colossal titan form  he still had his founding titan form  head therefore we can assume that he  created his colossal form out of his  founding titan nape his colossal titan  was the same height as armin's titan but  when they engaged in battle we could see  something fairly unusual aaron was able  to harden his titan's fists even in his  colossal titan form which was pretty  surprising since no other known user of  his power could do that aaron easily  gained the upper hand on armin and broke  his titan skull this is only my personal  opinion but i think that out of all  colossal titans we saw on the show aaron  is by far the strongest one he may even  be the strongest colossal titan that  ever existed click on this video where  we explained all jaw titans in attack on  titan

